      "answer": {
        "answer": "Field Lab was originally scheduled for August 16, 2026 at 09:00 PDT. Organizer revision r2 moved the current scheduled time to 11:30 PDT because of a facility delay and expressly supersedes r1 for the Field Lab schedule. The actual occurrence time is still unknown (`null`). The stale family copy remains historical evidence of the old 09:00 time; it cannot alter the official schedule because it is derivative and has no schedule authority, while organizer authority controls schedule facts.",
